    "open": "Public domain, CC0, CC BY, or equivalent. Free to use, redistribute and merge.",
    "nc": "Non-commercial only. Usable by this project (non-commercial, no ads, no paid tier) but must be isolated behind its own adapter so a change in project status means swapping one module.",
    "share-alike": "Copyleft (ODbL, CC BY-SA). Derived datasets inherit the licence. Must be stored separately and never merged into a general-purpose derived table.",
    "restricted": "No licence grant for reuse. Not ingested. Link-out only."
